 times more adorable? Now, they are the epitome of a lovey-dovey couple, kissing each other at the door every morning when they go to work. But the husband had just one problem. That is, he had never shared a bed with his wife... In other words, even though he was married, he was still a virgin!","year":2024,"status":"ongoing","lastChapter":null,"contentRating":"safe","tags":["Romance","Comedy"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/6b9bd81a-ae0f-4495-bde9-9ba20ee00981/777d943e-b840-4303-bf52-25e86db6ef49.jpg.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ja","availableLanguages":["en","vi","pt-br","zh","id"],"lane":"manga","rating":7.93,"follows":45930,"listAt":"2026-10-21T07:08:19.349Z","chapters":[{"id":"f2301d61-2084-4b23-b49d-9a1236b29c47","number":"8.2","volume":"3","title":null,"lang":"en","pages":27,"createdAt":"2026-02-22T03:15:48+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"8a0c5192-349b-4c0e-8685-e8a6dda690dc","number":"8.1","volume":"3","title":null,"lang":"en","pages":14,"createdAt":"2026-02-21T21:49:09+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"14e1e418-e8cd-49ef-91ae-5f02f83050e8","number":"7","volume":"2","title":null,"lang":"en","pages":24,"createdAt":"2026-01-10T18:25:27+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"e4e2c3a7-f4ae-44dc-87ed-4e151a5550eb","number":"6","volume":"2","title":null,"lang":"en","pages":20,"createdAt":"2025-12-04T05:54:21+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"3d967fb3-f8fa-476e-b883-991d600ad786","number":"5.2","volume":"2","title":null,"lang":"en","pages":22,"createdAt":"2025-10-09T17:32:26+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"b3b98e97-d7a8-48f1-b0cb-c8a7d45b77e4","number":"5.1","volume":"2","title":null,"lang":"en","pages":23,"createdAt":"2025-10-04T20:58:58+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"0181d5a5-e389-47c5-bb7e-72262d3a587c","number":"4","volume":"1","title":null,"lang":"en","pages":41,"createdAt":"2025-04-24T13:49:30+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"8d94ea52-2e9c-4c12-b8ff-d804002e36aa","number":"3","volume":"1","title":null,"lang":"en","pages":29,"createdAt":"2025-02-14T13:27:48+00:00","baked":fal